{"sections":[{"id":"noi-dung","title":"Nội dung hướng dẫn","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-194620","runs":[{"text":"Legends of Yokai\n","bold":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-194637","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part 1:","bold":true},{"text":" The Empire of Steel is attacking Yokai Isle. Empress Miko needs your help to pull off a ruse that should provide the cover she needs to smuggle her people to safety ("},{"text":"/join yokaipirate","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/yokai-pirate"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-194833","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part 2:","bold":true},{"text":" Admiral Zheng, known as the Radiant Mirage, is set to capture Yokai's Empress, a challenge that could alter the foundation of the Yokai Isles and its destiny ("},{"text":"/join yokaitreasure","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/yokai-treasure"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-195025","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8xAb1AwMOgA"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TyxFZFzImSs"},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-195066","runs":[{"text":"Yokai Dragon War\n","bold":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-195083","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part 1:","bold":true},{"text":" An ancient Dragon demands Empress Miko face him in combat, as her ancestor did, as her people's safety is at stake if she refuses or loses ("},{"text":"/join hakuvillage","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/haku-village"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-195253","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part 2:","bold":true},{"text":" Danger looms on two fronts: an army of invading dragons threatens the land while the Yokai themselves seek to kill Empress Miko ("},{"text":"/join hakuwar","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/haku-war"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-195408","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part 3:","bold":true},{"text":" Empress Miko's life is in danger due to being pulled through a mirror portal to the Yokai Realm, where Yokai are born and die ("},{"text":"/join yokaiportal","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/yokai-portal"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-195565","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part 4:","bold":true},{"text":" Ai no Miko, Empress of Yokai Isle, is a ruler who sacrifices her life to serve her people. With luck, skill, and ancestors' favor, you might save her before her spirit is lost forever, ensuring her survival ("},{"text":"/join yokairealm","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/yokai-realm"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-195803","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jFPLlNIMhD0"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HcwBUWr5-m4"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cMeUYmN3vfs"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 4","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PuVda2Vf0Zw"},{"text":"\n"}]}]}],"previous":{"title":"Darkon's Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/darkon-s-saga"},"next":{"title":"Shadows Rising Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/shadows-rising-saga"},"missingImageCount":2}